# Local Claude Code state, except the rules symlink and the one tracked
# contributor skill. `.claude/*` rather than `.claude/` so the negations
# work — git cannot re-include anything under an excluded directory, and
# each level has to be re-included in turn. Personal skills dropped in
# .claude/skills/ stay ignored.
.claude/*
!.claude/rules
!.claude/skills
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/harvesting-skill-review

# Superpowers workspaces (never commit)
.superpowers/
